      "body": " ## Summary\r\n\r\n  - Aligns Security Considerations with mandatory `human-continuity` signature coverage.\r\n  - Adds principal-association guidance and binds requested or asserted presentation-assurance evidence to the continuity scope and challenge nonce.\r\n  - Clarifies which metadata fetches prohibit cross-origin redirects.\r\n  - Fixes HTTP WG metadata, terminology, examples, security cross-references, and source-code markers.\r\n  - Tightens purpose-template schema validation.\r\n  - Hardens the publishing workflow against expression injection and limits it to `contents: read`.\r\n  - Fixes contributor guidance and a validator comment.",
